-- **And a rule file that gets it by consulting the publisher** (MS11 phase
-- 298). It imports nothing: `LC` reaches it because `Lends` says `public
-- import`, which is the same thing a surface file consulting `Lends` gets.
rule base borrows where

consult test.modules.Lends

open A

rule describe LC[app]`( ${f} ${a} )` :- do
  say "an application"
